  "title": "Fall Corn Rotisserie Chicken Soup",
  "description": "Sweet and savory rotisserie chicken and vegetable soup. The trick is making a sweet corn broth with the corncobs in chicken broth.",
  "authors": [
    "Christine Lofton"
  ],
